Subject: [PATCH] feat(brand-system): fuse logo-generator-skill; six-family
 bake-off and mark scorer

Marks produced by v2.1 (Huginn, Riso Co., Hachure) were an initial or a blob
plus an effect: no family diversity, name meaning ignored, orphan accent,
offsets that die at 16px.

- references/logo-brainstorm.md: diagnosis, concept bank, six families,
  design rules paraphrased from op7418/logo-generator-skill, exit criteria.
- brand-forge: five new concepts (dotmatrix, lines, overprint, nodes,
  monogram), hatch rebuilt as real hachure, tile "none", --bakeoff mode.
- scripts/score-mark.py: compact stroke/dot floors, silhouette, 16px contrast,
  detached specks, negative space, symmetry note.
- examples: worked redo of Huginn / Riso Co. / Hachure with runnable configs.
- SKILL.md, README, logo-system, skill-audit updated; v2.2.
